{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016115648330-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016152045\"/><p>事發在皇后大道中1號滙豐總行大廈。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>今日(16日)早上11時39分，中環皇后大道中1號滙豐總行大廈，有銀行職員報案，指有數名人士到上址要求開設戶口，職員辦理手續期間，發現涉事人提交的文件中有部分懷疑為虛假文書，遂報案求助。警員接報到場，經初步調查後，拘捕1名內地及3外籍人士，事件來龍去脈有待進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T09:00:05.875783+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:56:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:58:07.929985+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:58:17.775262+00:00","content_hash":"fae8ff01348a0092ce44aac423d633b9c89f9ca1dc5f226eeafe977b95fc6224","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}